  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "绝大多数操作被剥夺，只能滑动鼠标行动，而点击反会触发意外危险",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "You have been deprived of most of your control methods. What happened? Try to understand the world when you can only slide the mouse. But if you click the mouse, unexpected and dangerous things will happen.",
