      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "世界里藏有待破解的隐秘机关，宝箱小道具可作为解谜辅助",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "There are various hidden mechanisms around the world waiting for you to crack. You can get different small props in the treasure chest, let them help you.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2847740/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "每个限时循环都要滑鼠斩怪、解开知识锁定的谜题并寻找隐藏路线，尽量深入世界真相",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "In each time loop, slide the mouse to kill monsters, crack the puzzles locked by knowledge, and explore the hidden paths! Go deeper in a limited time and discover the truth of the world.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2847740/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
